+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- BLINK (Скачок)
+# Horizontal blink of <modifier.range> blocks (~5) in the facing direction.
+# Safe landing: 9 block ray traces (feet/waist/head height x left/center/right
+# edge of the player's hitbox). The blink stops 0.5 block before the first
+# obstacle, so the player can never end up inside a block. Yaw/pitch kept.
+# Not cast (no mana/cooldown) when looking straight up/down.
